      "title": "[Reactor Magazine] An Award-Based Anthology Series With a Difference",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://reactormag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/New-Voices-vol-1-3.png\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<img src=\"https://reactormag.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/New-Voices-vol-1-3.png\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\" />\n<p>Revisiting George R.R. Martin's innovative New Voices in Science Fiction series</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://reactormag.com/an-award-based-anthology-series-with-a-difference/\">An Award-Based Anthology Series With a Difference</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://reactormag.com\">Reactor</a>.</p>",
      "date_published": "2026-08-20T14:00:00+00:00",
